  "title": "Air Fryer Cod",
  "description": "Air fryer cod fillets are a great choice for an easy dinner. Dip frozen fillets in egg, bread in ranch-seasoned panko, and air-fry to crispy perfection.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
  ],
